          <transcript>bej-e -- tatan abxu </transcript>
          <definition>To win over to one’s side</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠡᠳᠦᠨ ᠲᠠᠺᠠᠰᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>kedyn -- </transcript>
          <definition> In several directions.</definition>
