          <transcript>nigen -- bolγaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To direct to one side.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠣᠷᠤᠢ ᠲᠠᠺᠠᠰᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>orui -- </transcript>
          <definition> Towards evening</definition>
